\fBsetTlsPins(pins, options)\fR
Set or extend runtime TLS certificate pins at runtime.
.br
Pins use the same format as the static `tls_pins` config:
.br
<host> sha256/<base64>
.br
Invalid entries throw a `TypeError`.
\fBParameters:\fR
.br
\fIpins\fR (string \\| string[]; required) a string or array of pin lines
.br
\fIoptions\fR (TlsPinsOptions; optional)
\fBReturns:\fR
.br
\fIPromise<{ ok: boolean, value: string }>\fR
.TP
